OL,3,GNEWSAConcern over road crossing delays
OL,4,Awhere man died
OL,5,
OL,6,FA developer has been told to "get a
OL,7,Fmove on" with an upgrade to a crossing
OL,8,Fwhere a mobility scooter rider in his
OL,9,F80s died in a crash last year.
OL,11,FCouncillor Geoffrey Samme said work on
OL,12,Fnew traffic lights and pedestrian
OL,13,Fcrossings at the roundabout at Royal
OL,14,FEngineers' Road and Staceys Street in
OL,15,FMaidstone had "ground to a halt".
OL,17,FThe existing crossing near Maidstone
OL,18,FUnited's stadium, used by residents,
OL,19,Fshoppers and football fans, is fenced
OL,20,Foff with a sign in place, but
OL,21,Fpedestrians still use it.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
