OL,3,GNEWSAConcern over road crossing delays
OL,4,Awhere man died
OL,5,
OL,6,FKent County Council (KCC) said it was
OL,7,Fworking closely with a developer and
OL,8,Fcontractor to make sure work was
OL,9,Fcompleted as quickly as possible.
OL,10,FDeveloper Redrow said displaced signage
OL,11,Fwas being put back.
